cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MUIO 5.6 - Community Edition (HiGHS)"
abstract: >-
  A Windows build of MUIO (Modelling User Interface for OSeMOSYS) with additional
  solver options, including HiGHS, for faster solving of large OSeMOSYS and CLEWs
  models. Solver output is converted to the format MUIO already reads, so results
  and visualisations are unchanged.
type: software
